{
  "id": "weather-clothes",
  "title": "看天氣挑衣服",
  "titleEn": "Choosing Clothes for the Weather",
  "category": "家庭生活",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/weather-clothes.webp",
    "alt": "在下雨的早晨，小男孩站在窗邊看著窗外的雨滴，媽媽在玄關微笑提醒，小男孩穿上黃色外套與雨靴並拿著雨傘，準備出門上學。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo looks out the "
        },
        {
          "text": "window",
          "wordIds": [
            "window"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " on a "
        },
        {
          "text": "rainy",
          "wordIds": [
            "rainy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " morning."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在下雨的早晨，Leo 看著窗外。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He looks at the raindrops and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look, it is raining!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-it-is-raining"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他看著雨滴說：「看，外面下雨了！」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "text": "weather",
          "wordIds": [
            "weather"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is cold and wet today."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "今天的天氣又冷又濕。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo runs to his room and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I need my ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-need-my-jacket"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jacket",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-need-my-jacket"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "jacket"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-need-my-jacket"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 跑到房間說：「我需要我的外套。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom smiles and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Put on your ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-on-your-boots"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "boots",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-on-your-boots"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "boots"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-on-your-boots"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽微笑著說：「穿上你的靴子。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom points to the door and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't forget your ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-umbrella"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umbrella",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-umbrella"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "umbrella"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "dont-forget-your-umbrella"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽指著門口說：「別忘了帶你的雨傘。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo takes his "
        },
        {
          "text": "umbrella",
          "wordIds": [
            "umbrella"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and smiles, ready to go outside."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 拿著雨傘微微笑，準備好走出家門。"
    }
  ],
